56
00:08:16,899 --> 00:08:21,970
We will discuss why it was modified later.

57
00:08:21,970 --> 00:08:28,360
For now, let us set up the environment so that it can run.

58
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:31,828
One important point:

59
00:08:31,828 --> 00:08:41,712
all machines must use the same folder name for this tool.

60
00:08:41,712 --> 00:08:53,850
Different names may work on one machine but cause problems on another.

61
00:08:53,850 --> 00:09:00,960
Please use the team-standard folder name.

62
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:06,740
To install Installer.bat, download it,

63
00:09:06,740 --> 00:09:15,410
run it with the appropriate permissions, and press Enter.

64
00:09:15,410 --> 00:09:24,840
It will install Python and the components needed for the tool.

65
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:32,984
I will demonstrate this now.

66
00:09:32,984 --> 00:09:53,343
You can follow along so that we can create a real project later today.

67
00:09:53,343 --> 00:10:02,650
Please download these two files.

68
